{
  "version": 1,
  "_doc": [
    "Repeatable synthetic fixture manifest for every surfaced route (functional-completeness-audit P0).",
    "baseSeeds establish the shared demo dataset (org/site/program, identities, enrollments); every fixtureRequired route is applied on top of them.",
    "recordCounts are MINIMUM synthetic records the route needs to render its designed experience, keyed by table.",
    "interactions are the operator-executable actions the seeded data must support; downstreamRecords are the canonical records those interactions must produce.",
    "fixtureRequired:false marks pages that legitimately render without seeded domain data (rationale required).",
    "Verification is STATIC_ONLY: this manifest proves declared coverage, not live execution. scripts/check-route-fixture-coverage.mjs enforces it in CI; unseeded routes are coverage failures."
  ],
